            <ArticleTitle>Pain after spinal intrathecal clonidine. An adverse interaction with tricyclic antidepressants?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1026-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case is reported in which spinal intrathecal administration of clonidine produced pain. The interaction between clonidine and tricyclic antidepressants is discussed, and is suggested as the basis for this observation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
